# ── Figma access (secrets implied by this file live in a local .env) ──────────
#
# Read-only Figma REST API token, used by the Phase 1 audit scripts in
# `scripts/`. It is NOT required to build the app — only to re-run the audit.
#
# The InstiServe design system is authored manually in the Figma UI; this token
# exists so the library can be *inspected* programmatically.
#
# Figma file:  5cx1t71DbC23GlziY7xZPQ  ("Workspace")
# Frames:      941:11077 (DESIGN SYSTEMS), 941:12316 (DESIGN SYSTEMS 2)
#
# Generate a personal access token at:
#   Figma → Settings → Security → Personal access tokens
#
# Required scope for the audit scripts:
#   file_content:read   (nodes, images)
#
# Optional, Enterprise-plan only — needed to READ variable names:
#   file_variables:read
# Without it, `figma-resolve-vars.mjs` still works: it recovers variable
# ID → resolved value from node bindings instead of listing variables.
#
# FIGMA_ACCESS_TOKEN=

# Optional overrides for the audit scripts (defaults match the InstiServe file)
# FIGMA_FILE_KEY=5cx1t71DbC23GlziY7xZPQ
# FIGMA_NODE_IDS=941-11077,941-12316